        </p>

        <QuickPicks products={PRODUCTS} />

        <div id="quick-comparison" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            1. Quick Comparison: The Best Matcha Protein Powders
          </h2>

          <p>
            The short version: if you want one scoop that does everything, NOW Sports Whey Protein with Matcha is the best ready-made option, because it uses real organic matcha and delivers about 26 g of whey protein. If you are dairy-free or avoid stevia, Truvani's matcha plant protein is the cleaner label. If you already drink matcha and like it, the better move is usually to add a scoop of vanilla or unflavored isolate to your own matcha, because you then control the grade, the sweetness and the caffeine. The table lines up all six on the numbers that matter, read from each label or listing at the time of writing.
