          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Real matcha is the whole point. Pick a powder that names matcha as an ingredient and states its caffeine, or build your own from a good vanilla or unflavored isolate and a tin of fresh, bright green matcha. NOW's whey with matcha is the easiest one-scoop answer, and Truvani's is the cleanest dairy-free, stevia-free label.
          </p>
